WEBVTT

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:13.750
Chihaya...

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.830
You are my...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.040
...number one.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.950
Imber turned on?!

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:29.410
Ribbon, what's going on? Ribbon!

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.250
Imber...

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.160
Same here!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:37.000
He suddenly activated.
What the blazes is going on?!

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:47.750
Here?

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.830
It's Aulyn?

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.370
There is a 99% plus probability it's him!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.120
The island's internal resonance
phenomenon suggests

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.540
that it is converging with
Aulyn's wave function.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:59.870
Interference with the gravitational layer
is altering the Konpeito's orbit.

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.290
If the layer doping persists at this rate,

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.330
there is a possibility that it could
affect the Earth's orbit.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.250
The next train:
This train service runs between here and Omiya.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.250
All trains to Tokyo are
not currently running.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:16.370
Fee
yen

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:15.950
What gives? I haven't been able to catch
any signals since yesterday.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:18.450
First Tokyo gets trashed and now this.

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.870
I haven't been getting
any customers, either.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.330
Damn it! I don't care if it's that Turiavita
or what have you.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:26.540
Welco-

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.750
Tokyo! Take me as close as you can.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.870
I know you can't take me there,
so just take me as close as you can!

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.370
Excuse me, but are you by chance
Miss Yayoi Takatsuki?

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:35.870
Yes...?

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.700
Wow, shit! You're the real deal!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.830
I always listen to your Yayoi-style Radio!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.870
Okay, okay! If that's
what you want, you got it!

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.040
In exchange, be sure
to give me your autograph!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.790
Okay!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.870
I even went to your
open recording session!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.120
Dang! Today is my lucky day.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.120
Haruka...

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.660
You want to see Nubilum?

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:59.620
Right. Imber and I want to go,
just the two of us.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.830
But...

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.410
Don't ask for the impossible!

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:06.290
Vulturius could fire at
that island at any time!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:09.250
Even so, we must go.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.870
Imber said he wants to go.

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.910
He told me he wants me to go with him.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.410
But still!

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.910
Please let her go.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.580
Tempestas is saying the exact same thing.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:19.910
Same here.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.330
Yeah, I know.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.910
That's where...

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:38.330
...we're headed, Imber!

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.910
Sorry, but out of my way!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.290
Underneath this sky, I have always

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:34.660
Continued to search for my dream

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:36.250
All alone...

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:41.870
Where does everyone go forth for their journey?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:47.410
The days in my memories grow distant

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.160
Your smile from back then supports my heart now

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:58.950
Your smile from back then supports my heart now

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:09.250
I'm sure that with our silent profiles, both you and I

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.830
Understood that these personas exist

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.370
Because of our injuries

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:20.040
We say we do this for happiness or for love

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:24.500
As we repeat this cruel battle

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.120
Yet even so, the tears won't stop

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.540
Our hopeful hearts are one

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:39.330
Our own futures are calling to us

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:46.950
Spring Snow

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.830
We have detected a gravitational
anomaly from inside the island

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.660
that we believe an iDOL core is emitting.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:50.450
It is still converging
with Aulyn's wave function.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:54.200
So that island's power unit
is producing Aulyn's anomalies.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.410
I have verified that a number of
flying objects has left the island.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.290
I believe they are all Epimetheus units.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.160
Speed up the preparations to fire Vulturius!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.790
What happened to the others?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.000
We got split up and I can't reach-

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.000
I found you!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:25.080
Hey, guys! Are all of
the Epi's going on a picnic?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.120
They are going to collect
the cores for Mama.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.370
What?! And I have to stay home?!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:47.700
The core!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.330
There are so many...

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.160
Wait!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.200
Where are you going in that condition?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.540
Please, hurry and tend to your injuries!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.160
Makoto...

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:27.620
I used your progress to meet my own ends.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:32.950
I made you feel anxious and confused.
I even drove you into a dead end.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.410
Sis...

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:46.290
I want you to let me pave the path
for you to follow.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.950
A path where you walk with the iDOLs...

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:58.830
Your iDOL is waiting for you.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.080
Sis... Sis!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.410
The path Sis made...

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:16.250
Will you go with me to see
what it leads to, Hiems?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.250
Prometheus 1 has engaged in combat
with numerous Epimetheus units.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.330
Their signals overlap, which prevents me
from determining the enemy's numbers.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.700
All of the signals are
crowding around Imber!

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:29.330
What is Nebula and Tempestas' status?

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.830
They have deployed near
Coastal Area, Block No. 6.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.370
They have connected
to Laser Line, System 4!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.200
We've finished connecting
the links and tracers.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.580
We're ready to go whenever!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.540
Amazing... The current has receded
as far as the eye can see.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.160
You ready? I'm heading out!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:49.750
I am. Both Tempestas and the two of us
can go whenever you like.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.950
Wait, wait! My hands are all sticky.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:57.370
Oh, I can't believe you.
Go on, wipe your mouth.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.040
Forget about that and hurry up!

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:05.160
Idiot Ribbon is eagerly waiting for us!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.120
There is no end to them.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.700
Jeez! And here I'm so close!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.830
What? The Epimetheus units are leaving...

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:41.750
Guys!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.370
They took the bait!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.290
The Epimetheus Mob is being lured away
by the guidance waves.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.040
They certainly rose
to take the bait, didn't they?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.790
It's easy to manipulate
simple-minded children.

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:54.250
The water here is yummy!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.950
So that means it was a success, right?

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:59.040
Well, we've set the stage!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:01.830
Now follow through
on your end, Idiot Ribbon!

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:29.910
Yukiho...

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.160
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm not afraid.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.410
Let's go, Imber.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.910
I've lost contact with Prometheus 1!
I can't recover his data link either.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.330
I can't analyze the source
of the frequency interference!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.870
There is over a total of 100
incoming Epimetheus units.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.040
The numbers are still rising!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.580
Just how many are there?!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.410
The Epimetheus Mob
is proceeding down Course 072.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:07.200
Prometheus 1's signal has vanished.
We believe it has gone inside of the island.

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.120
Or so they say.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.700
Isn't that most convenient?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:18.750
It means we can eradicate yet another iDOL
along with the ghost of Teru Lo-Wu.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:22.830
It is about time we suggested the
Restoration Plan to the other countries.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:23.580
Come to think of it,
doesn't the US have a President?

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:26.750
So they only get worked up
when money is involved, huh?
Come to think of it,
doesn't the US have a President?

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:29.040
The Epimetheus Mob is
crossing the Equator.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.160
Yukiho...

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.200
Here they come!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.660
Well, this is the moment of truth!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.910
And you know it too, don't you, Nebula?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.250
Let's go!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.290
Iori, safety first!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.370
Please don't forget that we are here
as Imber's backup!

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:17.290
Be sure to-

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.120
It's no fun to just attract them!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.750
At times like this, the star
is supposed to destroy them all!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.500
Next!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.870
Is Forehead a moron?

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.250
Nebula has intercepted
the Epimetheus units!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.750
I'm having Tempestas
fall back to the 2nd Line!

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.410
What is Aulyn's status?

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.370
Its interference waves are still increasing!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.450
There is a fluctuation in the orbit!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.700
Vulturius is fanning out. Confirm, please?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.750
I've already got my hands full!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.950
I can't help it!

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.500
Send the information over to me.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:55.790
At the very least, I should be able
to help buy some time.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:56.330
Sir...

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.330
We cannot pull back now!

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.660
Long time no see, huh?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:07.910
Oomph.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.250
I'm glad to see you're doing
better than I had imagined.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:17.000
I've been through a lot since you left,
Yukiho. And you see...

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:21.040
Please drop the act.
That sort of thing makes me sick.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.950
You're always like that.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.830
You've forgiven me for betraying you
and are acting all nice.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.580
That's the right thing to do, isn't it?

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.580
That's why you push that crap onto me.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:37.000
You don't know anything.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:41.040
You became Imber's Master
without having to work for it.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.950
You are loved by Imber.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:51.290
You know nothing of Chihaya's pain,
sadness, passion, feelings, nothing!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:58.950
You have nothing. So why...
Why does he love you?

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:05.160
Even if this is what Imber wants,
I don't care!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.160
I won't accept this.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:10.700
I...! I like you, Yukiho!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:12.660
I want to protect the iDOLs!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.700
That's all.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.500
You truly are selfish, aren't you?

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:24.620
You think you can grab onto
everything with that hand.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:36.410
I have but one desire!
It is down to one now!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.160
I will carve Chihaya's love into Imber!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.120
Imber!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.370
Imber...

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.790
I won't give up on anything!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.870
Vulturius has entered
the final phase before firing.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.750
I've confirmed that there
was a Minkowski Burst!

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.000
This is looking really bad!

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:03.450
We can still pull this off! How is Imber?

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.870
We still can't connect with him!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.700
Sir, there is a limit to how long
we can suppress Vulturius!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.160
We really should send Nebula to rescue-

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.580
Don't do that!

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.870
We're saying that she can't go.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:19.540
Right! Besides, trashing
these guys comes first!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.410
We're the only ones who can do that!

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:47.330
Makoto...?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.700
What are you doing here?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.370
After all this time!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.790
Nebula?!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.040
Hiems!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.790
Nebula, you...

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:10.500
You intentionally took that hit...?

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:14.910
Nebula says we're even now.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.200
Minase... Nebula...!

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.250
Don't get in my way, 'kay?

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.200
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.910
Let's do this!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.160
Yeah.

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:15.830
Chihaya, this is it!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.790
Isn't Vulturius ready to fire yet?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:23.580
I am sorry, but we are still working
to fend off outside interference.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.500
Hurry it up! Old farts aren't terribly patient.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.160
Sir!

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:29.540
Your efforts will be in vain.

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.540
Commander!

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.870
An Epimetheus is attacking
Headquarters in Geneva!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.080
What happened?!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:40.700
I've lost contact with them!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.750
Has Lady Luck finally come my way?
I've lost contact with them!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:42.290
Has Lady Luck finally come my way?
How did an Epimetheus get there?!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.000
Has Lady Luck finally come my way?
Someone give a status report!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.200
Has Lady Luck finally come my way?

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:53.000
With this, at long last...

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.250
...Chihaya's wish will...

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:03.370
Chihaya and Imber will become one!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:11.080
Chihaya, this is my love!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.250
Imber!

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:37.870
Imber, I've finally made it here.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.040
I'm with you... I'm inside of you.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:46.500
We can finally be... together.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.750
Chihaya?

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.950
Imber, where are you? Imber?

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:57.080
Imber! Answer me.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:02.290
Where is this? Imber? He isn't here.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:06.450
Where is this?
No one's here, not even me...

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.500
Isn't that...?
Where is this?
No one's here, not even me...

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.290
No! No! NO!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:18.910
Chihaya?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:25.290
Why? Why?!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.950
I'm sure that Imber-

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:32.370
No, it doesn't matter
if you're an iDOL or a human.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:36.660
That isn't what it means to become one
with the person you love.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:42.790
Being one with the person you love isn't
about becoming the same as that person.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:47.370
I'm sure it refers to how you find
new things about each other.

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:50.910
That's why there may be
a bunch of times when

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:54.160
you don't understand each other
or think you hate each other.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:59.450
But I'm sure it's for the best.
That's all he needed.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.620
Imber was watching Chihaya,

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:08.500
but she was so desperate to get Imber
to notice her that she never looked at him!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.750
I'm sure that wasn't real love!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:22.750
Look. This here is Nubilum.
He will protect us.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:35.830
Tell me, Nubilum. Where did we go wrong?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.700
Vulturius' output is increasing!
We've hit our limit!

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.700
Where is Imber?!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.450
I still can't say!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.540
Haruka!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.160
Fire.

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:00.250
Yukiho?

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.500
Haruka...

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:06.080
I'm sorry. And thank you.

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:10.660
Nubilum?!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.120
Mama!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:22.830
Mama!

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.830
Has everything truly been eradicated?

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.450
Well, that might have made
for a good last scene.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.250
What's going on?

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.200
Turiavita...

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.000
Turiavita has vanished.

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.000
It vanished?

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:34.250
Nubilum, you protected Yukiho
and the both of us...

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:05.250
Like a saint that crosses the ages

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:14.250
In what kind of loneliness did you cry?

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:23.120
Stretching out to a star so far away

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:31.660
Say, I'll depict my feelings, look up at the sky

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:43.080
Dear boy, if I always look for you in my heart

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:52.080
Ah, I'll release a light so strong it will envelop you

00:22:52.080 --> 00:23:01.000
That sparkling trail will be the guide for us both

00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:12.620
